OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Verdi
OL,6,     F4/5. Kate Molleson explores
OL,7,     FVerdi's battles with authority and
OL,8,     Fsocietal expectations.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FClassical guitarist Tohi Harada
OL,11,     Fplays live. Mark Simpson and
OL,12,     FTamara Stefanovich chat to Petroc
OL,13,     Fabout the world premiere of Mark's
OL,14,     Fpiano concerto.
